WEBVTT

01:50.080 --> 01:52.400
This is a gift I specially prepared.

01:53.440 --> 01:55.200
Is this a gift from Fang Jin?

01:57.400 --> 02:00.720
It seems like the gift from Fang Jin
matches your taste.

02:02.720 --> 02:05.280
Dr. Fang is knowledgeable, diligent,

02:05.360 --> 02:08.120
thoughtful, kind, and interesting.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.680
She's not the rumored nerd at all.

02:13.160 --> 02:15.160
Seems like Mr. Tang
really admires Fang Jin.

02:16.560 --> 02:18.920
Who wouldn't admire
such an outstanding and smart woman?

02:19.000 --> 02:20.200
Guan Shengyu.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.720
Fang Jin is both smart and capable.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.560
How did she end up marrying such a jerk?

02:26.080 --> 02:27.720
Guan Shengyu doesn't deserve Dr. Fang.

02:29.520 --> 02:32.400
When Fang Jin divorces Guan Shengyu,
she'll be free.

02:32.480 --> 02:33.880
You won't have to worry
about Guan Shengyu.

02:33.960 --> 02:35.800
You and Fang Jin can do whatever you want.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.120
What are you talking about?

02:38.200 --> 02:40.920
I purely admire and respect Dr. Fang.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.280
Sorry.

02:44.360 --> 02:46.680
I was talking
about the fiber elastic mesh.

02:46.760 --> 02:47.640
Without Guan Shengyu,

02:47.720 --> 02:50.960
you and Fang Jin
can do whatever you want about it.

02:52.200 --> 02:53.240
I know.

02:53.320 --> 02:56.320
You two are like brilliant minds
admiring each other,

02:56.400 --> 02:57.720
with absolutely no other intention.

03:03.400 --> 03:05.400
Do you still like Su Miao?

03:35.080 --> 03:35.960
Thanks.

03:36.960 --> 03:39.080
I enjoy role-playing.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.800
You're always welcome to let me have fun.

03:41.880 --> 03:43.000
Thanks to your cleverness,

03:43.080 --> 03:46.200
we tricked Tang Qi with the shadow.

03:47.160 --> 03:48.840
I make a living from this.

03:48.920 --> 03:51.280
It's an old trick, not fresh at all.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.640
Chengcheng is a real genius.

03:52.720 --> 03:54.760
She successfully played Dr. Fang Jin.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.360
She's a genius?

03:56.440 --> 03:57.680
There were flaws everywhere.

03:57.760 --> 04:00.360
I asked her to study the data,
but she couldn't memorize it.

04:00.440 --> 04:03.640
She kept talking about makeup.

04:03.720 --> 04:06.400
Also, how could Fang Jin
be as silly as Chengcheng?

04:06.480 --> 04:08.320
She was about to shake hands with Tang Qi,

04:08.400 --> 04:11.080
talking about how heroes see eye to eye.

04:11.160 --> 04:12.920
A real touch of the underworld.

04:14.320 --> 04:15.800
Did Tang Qi doubt it?

04:19.200 --> 04:20.880
Tang Qi had never seen Fang Jin,

04:20.959 --> 04:23.520
so he thought she was just like that.

04:47.040 --> 04:49.240
Do you still like Su Miao?

04:54.280 --> 04:56.160
Do I still like Su Miao?

05:07.400 --> 05:10.360
You two are like brilliant minds
admiring each other,

05:10.440 --> 05:11.520
with absolutely no other intention.

06:13.160 --> 06:14.000
Su Miao,

06:15.720 --> 06:16.680
where are you?

06:17.960 --> 06:19.640
Because of work,

06:20.920 --> 06:23.280
I met a very outstanding woman,

06:24.000 --> 06:25.280
Dr. Fang Jin.

06:26.760 --> 06:29.280
Her professional quality impressed me.

06:31.760 --> 06:33.160
Su Chengcheng asked me,

06:34.600 --> 06:35.880
"Do you still like Su Miao?"

06:38.360 --> 06:39.880
I was really angry.

06:42.200 --> 06:44.640
Su Chengcheng thought I was mad at her,

06:46.840 --> 06:48.240
but actually, at that moment,

06:50.280 --> 06:52.160
I was a bit flustered.

06:53.400 --> 06:54.840
I was mad at myself.

06:57.160 --> 06:59.560
Because when I worked with Fang Jin,

07:02.160 --> 07:03.680
I actually forgot about you.

07:05.720 --> 07:09.040
I angrily scolded Su Chengcheng
for sprouting nonsense,

07:10.440 --> 07:11.480
but in fact,

07:13.680 --> 07:15.960
I couldn't face my true self.

07:18.360 --> 07:20.520
I should have scolded myself.

07:22.440 --> 07:23.320
Su Miao.

07:27.280 --> 07:29.080
It seems like I'm about to forget you.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.760
Tang Qi.

07:48.160 --> 07:49.920
You're a jerk.

07:52.680 --> 07:56.040
A jerk who falls in love
with everyone he meets.

08:09.720 --> 08:12.160
How could you be like this?

08:42.280 --> 08:45.480
Wasn't the meeting with Fang Jin
yesterday very pleasant?

08:46.120 --> 08:48.600
Why do you look so out of spirits?

08:48.680 --> 08:51.280
Last night, I watched an old movie
with my girlfriend,

08:51.360 --> 08:52.360
called City of Angels.

08:52.440 --> 08:54.520
The female lead died.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.360
My girlfriend cried her eyes out.

08:56.440 --> 08:57.360
Later, she insisted on asking me

08:57.440 --> 09:00.080
whether I'd live alone for the rest
of my life like the male lead

09:00.160 --> 09:02.240
if one day she suddenly died.

09:19.120 --> 09:22.520
Is it because I mentioned
Su Miao last night?

09:23.120 --> 09:25.440
Seems Tang Qi still can't forget Su Miao.

09:33.840 --> 09:34.680
Come in.

09:41.920 --> 09:43.040
Mr. Tang,

09:43.120 --> 09:44.680
you probably didn't have breakfast.

09:44.760 --> 09:45.840
I brought you breakfast.

09:45.920 --> 09:47.880
It's organic and healthy.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.640
We're just ordinary colleagues.

09:54.640 --> 09:55.480
Do ordinary colleagues

09:56.080 --> 09:58.200
exchange breakfast now?

10:00.560 --> 10:02.160
My sister asked me to do this.

10:03.240 --> 10:05.680
Yesterday's gift was from Fang Jin.

10:05.760 --> 10:07.120
This is from my sister.

10:13.240 --> 10:15.160
No need. Take it back.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.680
Tang, Guan Shengyu has decided

10:23.760 --> 10:25.440
to sell the elastic mesh patent to Vandai.

10:26.560 --> 10:27.440
According to reliable sources,

10:27.520 --> 10:29.240
they'll sign the contract this morning.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.080
Tang?

10:42.480 --> 10:44.920
I'll contact Fang Jin now
to discuss what to do.

11:00.600 --> 11:01.640
TANG QI

11:12.840 --> 11:14.440
I'm not available to take calls now.

11:14.520 --> 11:16.600
Is this about Guan Shengyu and Vandai?

11:17.240 --> 11:18.440
Fang Jin already knows?

11:21.160 --> 11:22.280
What are her plans?

11:22.920 --> 11:24.400
Qingli and I just discussed it.

11:24.480 --> 11:27.520
We have an idea, but we need your help.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.520
TANG QI

11:31.600 --> 11:33.520
No problem. What do you need me to do?

11:39.160 --> 11:41.400
We'll need you to have a cup of coffee.

11:45.880 --> 11:49.560
Those who are willing will bite the hook.

11:52.760 --> 11:55.280
Dr. Fang surprises me everywhere.

11:56.480 --> 11:59.080
The Marketing Department
will pay for the coffee.

12:06.640 --> 12:09.240
Remember to get ready.
We need to visit Mr. Zhang this afternoon.

12:10.480 --> 12:12.240
If you want to give the best product
to the customers,

12:12.320 --> 12:13.840
you need the best manufacturers.

12:15.480 --> 12:16.320
Alright.

12:44.760 --> 12:45.760
Hello, Mr. Tang.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.560
I've arrived at Vandai.

12:48.640 --> 12:49.480
What?

12:50.280 --> 12:53.040
You and Ms. Xiang
are meeting at the café downstairs?

12:53.120 --> 12:54.120
Now?

12:57.760 --> 12:58.720
- Well.
- It's done.

12:58.800 --> 13:00.280
OK, I'll keep it confidential.

13:00.360 --> 13:01.560
I'm coming now.

13:13.160 --> 13:14.800
FIBER ELASTIC MESH SYNTHESIS PROCESS

13:17.200 --> 13:18.080
FIBER TECHNOLOGY

13:21.080 --> 13:21.920
Thank you.

13:27.040 --> 13:29.920
Tang Qi, you're ruining my plans again.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.240
Qingli.

13:54.600 --> 13:57.240
Mr. Tang is running off to drink coffee
during work hours?

13:59.480 --> 14:01.920
- Can't I be here?
- Sure, no problem.

14:02.680 --> 14:03.840
I heard you're meeting Ms. Xiang here.

14:03.920 --> 14:05.120
Is that right?

14:07.520 --> 14:08.680
I don't know what you're talking about.

14:08.760 --> 14:10.560
I'm just here for a cup of coffee.

14:10.640 --> 14:12.280
Stop pretending.

14:12.880 --> 14:13.800
I'm meeting Ms. Xiang too.

14:13.880 --> 14:15.840
We can have coffee together

14:15.920 --> 14:17.440
and then head to the conference room.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.680
Sir, what would you like to drink?

14:21.760 --> 14:22.960
No need. The same as him.

14:23.040 --> 14:24.040
OK, just a moment.

15:41.880 --> 15:43.160
Hello.

15:43.240 --> 15:44.920
I'm Fang Jin from Xinnan Technology.

15:45.000 --> 15:46.680
I'd like to meet with Ms. Xiang.

15:46.760 --> 15:49.240
Dr. Fang Jin, are you with Mr. Guan?

15:50.440 --> 15:51.280
Yes.

15:51.360 --> 15:53.560
But Mr. Guan can't be here now.
He'll be a little late.

15:54.440 --> 15:56.760
Ms. Xiang is in the conference room.
Please follow me.

16:01.800 --> 16:04.560
What's going on with Guan Shengyu?

16:04.640 --> 16:06.440
He urged us to discuss it,

16:06.520 --> 16:08.400
but now he's late.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.800
Could it be a negotiation tactic?

16:10.880 --> 16:13.400
He's putting psychological pressure on us
to get us to raise the price.

16:13.480 --> 16:15.840
Should I contact Mr. Guan?

16:25.760 --> 16:27.640
Ms. Xiang, Xinnan Technology is here.

16:31.520 --> 16:32.440
Sorry, Ms. Xiang.

16:35.200 --> 16:37.840
Ms. Xiang, I'm Fang Jin
from Xinnan Technology.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.080
I'm sorry for being late today.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.520
Dr. Fang Jin?

16:42.760 --> 16:43.760
I've long heard of you.

16:44.280 --> 16:45.880
I didn't expect you to come today.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.320
Nice to meet you.

16:47.400 --> 16:49.800
We've been following your research.

16:49.880 --> 16:53.440
We take this cooperation
very seriously and look forward to it.

16:54.400 --> 16:55.320
Dr. Fang Jin.

16:55.400 --> 16:57.320
Her reputation in the industry
is well-known.

16:57.920 --> 16:59.720
Ms. Xiang, you're impressive too.

16:59.800 --> 17:02.320
It's an honor to get your approval.

17:02.400 --> 17:04.359
People in the industry say Dr. Fang Jin

17:04.440 --> 17:06.520
is aloof and dedicated to research.

17:07.119 --> 17:09.400
But today, it doesn't seem true.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.280
You're both smart and sweet.

17:20.040 --> 17:21.880
Where is Mr. Guan? Why isn't he here?

17:24.040 --> 17:27.720
Ms. Xiang, I'm here today
to tell you face-to-face

17:29.000 --> 17:31.440
that I cannot sell this patent
to your company.

17:52.440 --> 17:54.120
I've talked with Ms. Xiang.

17:54.200 --> 17:55.040
Everything went smoothly.

17:55.120 --> 17:57.360
Hello. The bill, please.

17:59.520 --> 18:00.920
That gentleman came uninvited.

18:01.000 --> 18:01.880
He's not my friend.

18:01.960 --> 18:03.040
Alright.

18:03.120 --> 18:05.440
We'll settle his bill later.

18:10.360 --> 18:11.760
Wait. What do you mean?

18:11.840 --> 18:13.280
Ms. Xiang isn't coming, huh?

18:13.360 --> 18:14.400
You're lying to me, right?

18:15.000 --> 18:16.680
I never said Ms. Xiang was coming.

18:16.760 --> 18:18.960
I told you there was a misunderstanding.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.760
I'm just here for a cup of coffee.

18:22.800 --> 18:25.600
Tang Qi, are you messing with me?

18:25.680 --> 18:26.960
Sir, you haven't paid the bill.

18:29.840 --> 18:30.880
- Is this okay?
- Sure.

18:36.520 --> 18:38.960
Dr. Fang, though we can't
cooperate this time,

18:39.040 --> 18:42.320
please make sure to consider us
for your future research.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.440
OK.

18:43.520 --> 18:45.520
Thank you for your understanding.

18:46.080 --> 18:49.320
I should thank you
for telling us the truth.

18:49.400 --> 18:51.440
- It's nothing.
- Ms. Xiang.

18:51.520 --> 18:52.640
Alas.

18:52.720 --> 18:54.360
I'm really sorry I'm late.

18:54.440 --> 18:56.680
I was set up by a schemer, so I'm late.

18:56.760 --> 18:57.880
Sorry, sorry.

18:57.960 --> 19:00.040
It's not too late.
Our cooperation has been canceled.

19:00.120 --> 19:02.040
Canceled?

19:03.080 --> 19:04.240
What do you mean?

19:08.360 --> 19:11.960
I just told the truth.

19:12.040 --> 19:15.000
Ms. Xiang, you must not let her fool you.

19:15.080 --> 19:16.280
Did she say I cheated while married?

19:16.360 --> 19:17.760
Did she say I abused her?

19:19.040 --> 19:21.360
These are one-sided accusations.

19:21.440 --> 19:24.160
She's just slandering me,
and I have evidence.

19:24.240 --> 19:26.000
I can prove that she was the one
who abused me.

19:28.080 --> 19:30.240
Wait, Ms. Xiang. Ms. Xiang…

19:30.800 --> 19:33.160
You better explain this,
or you'll get nothing.

19:33.240 --> 19:34.360
Do you hear me?

19:35.240 --> 19:36.680
Ow.

19:37.320 --> 19:39.120
- What?
- Are you okay?

19:41.200 --> 19:42.800
I didn't push her.

19:42.880 --> 19:44.000
I didn't try to hurt her.

19:44.080 --> 19:45.920
She did it on purpose.

19:46.000 --> 19:47.680
She set me up so I was late today.

19:47.760 --> 19:50.120
She's slandering me in front of you--

19:50.200 --> 19:52.360
Dr. Fang didn't say
anything bad about you.

19:52.440 --> 19:54.320
She didn't even mention
her personal matters.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.200
She only told us

19:56.280 --> 19:58.440
that the design
of the elastic mesh has flaws

19:58.520 --> 19:59.520
and needs time to improve.

19:59.600 --> 20:01.240
On the contrary, Mr. Guan…

20:13.320 --> 20:14.360
I didn't expect this to happen.

20:14.440 --> 20:15.360
Yeah.

20:51.920 --> 20:54.280
Fang Jin, stop pretending.

20:54.360 --> 20:55.520
You ruined my plans.

20:58.760 --> 21:00.080
So what?

21:00.760 --> 21:02.360
What can you do to me?

21:07.040 --> 21:08.680
What can I do to you?

21:21.840 --> 21:23.280
It hurts!

21:24.920 --> 21:26.760
Stop hitting me, okay?

21:26.840 --> 21:29.200
- I was wrong. Please stop hitting me.
- What are you doing?

21:29.280 --> 21:31.120
Don't hit me, please.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.920
Please, stop hitting me.

21:33.000 --> 21:34.000
When did I hit you?

21:34.080 --> 21:35.200
- Don't shout.
- Help.

21:35.280 --> 21:36.880
- It hurts! He's hitting me!
- Shut up.

21:36.960 --> 21:40.400
Help! He's hitting me! Help!

21:41.080 --> 21:42.360
- Don't shout.
- Help…

21:46.600 --> 21:47.480
Are you hurt?

21:48.280 --> 21:49.320
I…

21:52.040 --> 21:54.080
I don't need your protection.

21:54.680 --> 21:57.120
- You do.
- I don't.

21:57.200 --> 21:59.600
- You do.
- I don't.

22:01.720 --> 22:02.560
I'm still here.

22:03.240 --> 22:04.160
What are you two doing?

22:05.600 --> 22:07.720
Tang Qi, I've figured it out.

22:07.800 --> 22:10.400
You gave up such a huge benefit
and tried to stop me multiple times.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.600
So, you two…

22:13.560 --> 22:14.960
You two have been together
for a while, huh?

22:15.040 --> 22:17.640
You two worked together against me.

22:19.520 --> 22:20.640
Stop it!

22:22.760 --> 22:24.280
- My arm, my arm!
- Are you okay?

22:24.360 --> 22:26.200
Let go! Let go!

22:26.280 --> 22:27.600
I'll handle this. You two should leave.

22:27.680 --> 22:28.880
OK.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.200
Who are you? Let go!

22:30.280 --> 22:31.760
My arm hurts! Go easy on me.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.200
Alright, you two.

22:33.280 --> 22:34.520
You'll regret this.

22:36.000 --> 22:36.920
Follow me.

22:46.080 --> 22:47.920
You're bad at fighting.

22:48.000 --> 22:50.520
Don't try to act like a hero.

23:00.320 --> 23:02.160
Should I just watch you get beaten?

23:02.240 --> 23:05.560
What I need is a witness,
not a newbie fighter.

23:08.320 --> 23:10.840
You did it on purpose back at Vandai?

23:10.920 --> 23:12.840
Yeah. What else did you think?

23:18.240 --> 23:19.360
I've been too nosy.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.400
It's fine.

23:21.040 --> 23:22.520
You were being kind.

23:26.520 --> 23:28.800
It's just a small injury, nothing serious.

23:29.840 --> 23:32.160
Are you going to meet
with the manufacturer later?

23:32.240 --> 23:33.200
Is that okay?

23:36.120 --> 23:38.120
Don't worry. Since I've brought it up,

23:38.200 --> 23:39.760
I can definitely help you sort it out.

23:44.360 --> 23:45.880
This is medicine cosmetics.

23:45.960 --> 23:47.680
It's all vitamin E.

23:48.640 --> 23:50.280
It won't affect your wound.

23:52.880 --> 23:56.360
I learned this
from a makeup competition show.

23:56.440 --> 23:57.800
There was an episode

23:57.880 --> 24:00.400
dedicated to covering wounds.

24:01.520 --> 24:03.360
You like makeup shows?

24:03.440 --> 24:04.360
Yeah.

24:12.920 --> 24:16.440
I work in cosmetics tools.

24:17.040 --> 24:19.320
How could I do research
without knowing makeup?

25:32.880 --> 25:33.920
Take a look.

25:41.080 --> 25:44.000
You can't tell at all
unless you look up close, right?

26:12.040 --> 26:14.200
Why are you looking at me?
What's on my face?

26:14.280 --> 26:15.120
I…

26:16.640 --> 26:18.000
By the way, how did you know

26:18.080 --> 26:19.640
I'm meeting the manufacturer later?

26:23.040 --> 26:24.280
You said so.

26:25.440 --> 26:27.080
Before you went to the café,

26:27.160 --> 26:29.040
you talked to me about Guan Shengyu
and mentioned it.

26:30.480 --> 26:31.480
I said that?

26:32.680 --> 26:33.520
You did.

26:34.880 --> 26:38.280
You're just too focused
on the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh patent,

26:38.960 --> 26:39.960
so you got flustered.

26:40.560 --> 26:42.000
It's okay.

26:42.080 --> 26:44.480
Sometimes when people get nervous,

26:44.560 --> 26:46.280
they don't know what they're saying.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.520
I got flustered.

26:51.120 --> 26:52.040
I got flustered.

27:05.080 --> 27:06.040
TBC

27:17.320 --> 27:19.120
No matter how complicated
the elastic mesh is,

27:19.200 --> 27:20.880
we can produce it.

27:20.960 --> 27:23.440
But no matter what we produce,

27:23.520 --> 27:24.800
it needs to be arranged in advance.

27:25.520 --> 27:26.560
Mr. Zhang is right.

27:27.080 --> 27:30.000
We came here early
to discuss it with you properly.

27:30.080 --> 27:31.680
You can't even decide

27:31.760 --> 27:34.160
whether it's a multi-layered
fiber elastic mesh

27:34.240 --> 27:36.120
or an Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

27:36.200 --> 27:39.600
The Air Fiber Elastic Mesh's indicators
are still uncertain.

27:39.680 --> 27:41.600
You're not sure of anything.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.960
How am I supposed to arrange production?

27:43.040 --> 27:46.120
After all, you're not our only client.

27:46.200 --> 27:47.360
Yes, yes.

27:47.880 --> 27:50.120
I know this is indeed difficult,

27:50.200 --> 27:53.040
so we invited Dr. Tang

27:55.120 --> 27:57.960
to explain the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.320
Yes.

28:03.480 --> 28:05.440
To provide our customers
with a better experience,

28:06.600 --> 28:07.880
the developer of the elastic mesh

28:07.960 --> 28:10.080
hopes we can give her more time.

28:11.760 --> 28:14.240
Mr. Zhang, please give us more time.

28:18.280 --> 28:21.040
- Yes.
- Mr. Gu, Mr. Tang,

28:21.120 --> 28:22.960
I admire you both.

28:23.040 --> 28:25.200
I also want to help you,

28:25.280 --> 28:26.880
but in business terms,

28:26.960 --> 28:29.480
we really can't take this order.

28:30.680 --> 28:31.520
Wait.

28:32.520 --> 28:35.360
- Fanfan, why are you here?
- Mr. Zhang.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.920
Dad, I just wanted to see you.

28:45.760 --> 28:47.600
I'll go to read comics.

28:47.680 --> 28:48.520
Sure.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.480
Dad,

28:54.080 --> 28:56.440
I want to do some sketching this weekend.

28:59.080 --> 29:01.080
Alright, I'll take you to the suburbs.

29:06.040 --> 29:08.360
The nanny said
Fanfan cried secretly after looking

29:08.440 --> 29:09.720
at each signed book

29:09.800 --> 29:11.760
and then came here to see you.

29:13.080 --> 29:14.680
TO: FANFAN

29:21.480 --> 29:25.360
I didn't expect Mr. Gu
to be so thoughtful. Thank you.

29:26.400 --> 29:27.520
I don't deserve the credit.

29:27.600 --> 29:28.840
It's Fanfan who has great taste.

29:28.920 --> 29:32.160
She likes an author
who's both kind and talented.

29:34.880 --> 29:36.120
To be honest,

29:36.840 --> 29:39.720
why do I work so hard for money?

29:39.800 --> 29:41.720
Isn't it to make my family live better?

29:42.600 --> 29:43.960
As long as my daughter is happy,

29:44.040 --> 29:46.080
I'm happier than if I earned money.

29:47.200 --> 29:50.760
Dr. Tang is being serious
for the sake of the customers.

29:51.360 --> 29:52.960
I'm confident
in your long-term development.

29:53.040 --> 29:56.160
For this order, I can lose some benefits

29:56.240 --> 29:57.960
and adjust the production plan
to cooperate with you.

30:02.560 --> 30:04.120
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

30:05.600 --> 30:07.720
This has caused a lot of trouble
for the company.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.440
Thank you for this.

30:10.520 --> 30:12.040
Isn't that how business works?

30:12.120 --> 30:13.920
Troubles always come right after another.

30:14.000 --> 30:16.200
I actually want to thank you
for causing trouble

30:16.280 --> 30:18.760
because it gave me the chance
to get to know Lin Yuan.

30:21.120 --> 30:22.760
What did Lin Yuan do

30:22.840 --> 30:25.160
that made Mr. Zhang
change his attitude so drastically?

30:25.960 --> 30:26.960
Lin Yuan?

30:29.360 --> 30:30.720
All the books are signed.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.760
TO: FANFAN

30:43.960 --> 30:45.480
TO: FANFAN

30:48.160 --> 30:49.560
TO: FANFAN

30:59.120 --> 31:01.720
Did you sign every single one like this?

31:02.320 --> 31:03.320
Is there a problem?

31:04.480 --> 31:05.640
No.

31:05.720 --> 31:09.040
But with so many books,
isn't it troublesome?

31:12.360 --> 31:14.080
It's very fast for me.

31:31.960 --> 31:35.320
Are you this careful with every reader?

31:35.400 --> 31:36.360
Of course not.

31:37.120 --> 31:39.440
I'm China's best-selling comic author,

31:39.520 --> 31:40.960
with over a million readers.

31:41.040 --> 31:43.640
If I signed like this for every reader,
I wouldn't have time to create.

31:47.800 --> 31:50.600
Thank you for going
through so much trouble for me.

31:50.680 --> 31:51.520
I…

31:54.520 --> 31:55.360
It's not about me?

31:59.200 --> 32:00.360
Then why?

32:01.600 --> 32:04.760
Fanfan reminds me of myself.

32:14.760 --> 32:16.000
TO: FANFAN

32:24.280 --> 32:25.240
Stop overthinking.

32:25.840 --> 32:28.760
My parents are healthy
and will live long lives.

32:30.280 --> 32:31.120
I…

32:31.200 --> 32:32.440
I'm sorry.

32:33.120 --> 32:35.680
I just rarely see your parents
in the photos.

32:38.120 --> 32:41.120
My mom moved to Sichuan for love,

32:41.200 --> 32:43.760
but when I was seven,
their relationship broke down.

32:43.840 --> 32:45.120
My parents divorced,

32:45.200 --> 32:48.200
and I was tossed around like a ball.

32:48.840 --> 32:51.040
Later, they both remarried.

32:51.120 --> 32:53.680
My dad took his wife to Canada,

32:53.760 --> 32:56.040
and my mom went to France
with her husband.

32:57.080 --> 33:00.120
Now, they both have kids and are happy.

33:02.000 --> 33:02.840
What about you?

33:03.440 --> 33:04.720
I'm doing well, too.

33:09.240 --> 33:10.800
Fanfan is just afraid

33:10.880 --> 33:13.000
that after losing her mom,
she'll lose her dad as well.

33:13.080 --> 33:15.080
So, she became like a little hedgehog.

33:15.160 --> 33:17.520
I just used my art to tell her

33:18.200 --> 33:19.920
that her dad loves her very much,

33:20.000 --> 33:21.040
and she won't lose him.

33:29.280 --> 33:31.000
No matter who you're doing this for,

33:31.080 --> 33:33.000
I've received your kindness.

33:33.080 --> 33:34.360
You're welcome.

33:34.440 --> 33:35.600
My heroine is waiting for you.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.760
I won't disappoint her.

33:49.120 --> 33:51.440
You have saved it, right?

33:53.480 --> 33:55.560
All her hard work was gone,

33:55.640 --> 33:58.160
but Lin Yuan only felt down
for a little while

33:58.240 --> 33:59.120
before she cheered up again.

33:59.200 --> 34:01.520
So, we should thank Lin Yuan for this too.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.280
Yeah.

34:06.880 --> 34:07.920
What's wrong with you?

34:08.840 --> 34:11.040
You messed up Guan Shengyu,

34:11.120 --> 34:12.920
and the deal with Mr. Zhang is settled.

34:13.440 --> 34:14.840
Why do you still look so troubled?

34:17.320 --> 34:18.360
It's nothing.

34:24.560 --> 34:25.560
Why not make a call

34:26.679 --> 34:28.239
and ask Fang Jin out?

34:28.320 --> 34:29.920
Let's celebrate together tonight.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.040
No.

34:31.600 --> 34:33.600
Obviously, something's troubling you.

34:34.880 --> 34:37.639
What's going on between you and Fang Jin?

34:38.480 --> 34:39.320
I…

34:43.840 --> 34:44.719
I…

34:48.239 --> 34:49.840
Fang Jin made me a little flustered.

34:57.720 --> 35:00.640
Aren't you going to say something?

35:02.440 --> 35:04.400
What's there to say?

35:04.480 --> 35:05.680
It's not like I made you flustered.

35:06.960 --> 35:10.320
It's natural for a man
to feel something about a woman.

35:12.760 --> 35:14.520
Su Miao's bones aren't even cold,

35:16.080 --> 35:17.520
and I've fallen for someone else.

35:20.760 --> 35:22.120
I've just realized

35:23.960 --> 35:25.640
that I'm such a jerk.

35:27.560 --> 35:29.480
I've only just realized that too.

35:29.560 --> 35:30.400
What did you say?

35:31.160 --> 35:35.080
Nothing. Maybe your feelings for Su Miao

35:35.160 --> 35:37.920
were just shallow affection.

35:38.000 --> 35:40.360
Since Su Miao is gone so quickly,

35:40.440 --> 35:43.440
you've mistaken an illusion
for real feelings.

35:45.000 --> 35:45.880
No.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.600
I know that's not it.

35:50.680 --> 35:55.120
Then maybe your feelings for Fang Jin
are just an illusion.

35:55.200 --> 35:57.280
After spending more time with her,
you'll realize

35:57.880 --> 36:00.640
you've mistaken sympathy for love.

36:09.640 --> 36:10.480
Stop the car.

36:12.560 --> 36:13.440
Stop the car.

36:22.400 --> 36:24.360
- What are you doing?
- I'm going to see Fang Jin.

36:24.440 --> 36:26.360
DIDI RIDE-HAILING

36:29.960 --> 36:30.800
I…

36:32.960 --> 36:36.520
I was just trying to comfort you
since you looked so miserable.

36:37.200 --> 36:38.520
- Let's go, Linlin.
- Let's go.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.640
We're leaving, Yi.

36:50.480 --> 36:52.440
Now, it's just you and Yi on your team,

36:52.520 --> 36:54.000
so it's not so easy to slack off.

36:54.080 --> 36:55.240
Work hard.

36:58.640 --> 37:01.000
Xu Yue speaks like this all the time.
Don't take it to heart.

37:01.600 --> 37:02.560
It's my fault.

37:02.640 --> 37:04.080
I've taken too many leaves

37:04.160 --> 37:05.520
and left a bad impression on everyone.

37:05.600 --> 37:07.920
I believe you must have your reasons.

37:08.800 --> 37:09.960
Thanks.

37:16.280 --> 37:18.400
Dr. Fang, are you off work?

37:18.480 --> 37:21.320
Would you like to have dinner tonight?

37:25.240 --> 37:27.360
Sorry, I need to work overtime tonight.

37:39.000 --> 37:40.240
I'm heading to your lab now to find you.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.400
It won't take too much of your time.

37:49.840 --> 37:51.680
Yi, I need to take a leave.

37:51.760 --> 37:53.240
Something urgent came up,
so I can't work overtime.

37:54.160 --> 37:56.440
I know I promised
I'd be available anytime…

37:58.080 --> 37:59.000
Go ahead.

37:59.080 --> 38:01.600
I've said I believe
that you must have a valid reason.

38:02.640 --> 38:04.160
I'll make sure I don't hold up work.

38:05.960 --> 38:06.800
I'm leaving now.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.840
Please shut down the computer. Thank you.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.640
XINNAN TECHNOLOGY

38:29.360 --> 38:33.720
HOI KEE RESTAURANT

38:40.520 --> 38:41.560
Su Chengcheng?

39:01.400 --> 39:02.600
Please come in.

39:05.400 --> 39:07.160
I just saw Su Chengcheng downstairs.

39:07.720 --> 39:09.040
She should be here to see you.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.120
Chengcheng?

39:14.840 --> 39:16.040
You must've seen it wrong.

39:16.120 --> 39:17.840
She didn't say she was coming today.

39:19.640 --> 39:20.520
The back looked like her.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.600
You haven't had dinner yet, right?

39:23.680 --> 39:24.880
I brought takeout for you.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.160
Sorry, I dropped by suddenly.

39:33.520 --> 39:35.280
Is there something urgent?

39:36.200 --> 39:37.040
Well…

39:37.880 --> 39:40.120
I've got some technical issues
I can't figure out

39:40.200 --> 39:41.040
to ask you for advice.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.400
Technical issues?

39:48.200 --> 39:49.640
Well, I'm hungry.

39:49.720 --> 39:51.080
How about we eat first?

39:51.160 --> 39:52.360
Alright.

40:00.200 --> 40:02.240
Are you working overtime alone?
Without any researchers with you?

40:03.000 --> 40:04.840
When you said you'd come,
I asked everyone to leave first.

40:11.200 --> 40:13.560
- OK, thanks.
- Actually, I should be thanking you.

40:13.640 --> 40:15.600
Thank you for bringing me
such a nice dinner.

40:51.040 --> 40:52.280
Don't avoid it.

40:52.360 --> 40:53.400
Get to know her better,

40:54.280 --> 40:56.880
and I'll realize it's just an illusion.

41:09.440 --> 41:12.200
Tang Qi looks so eager for knowledge.

41:13.360 --> 41:16.200
Looks like this issue is difficult.

41:17.840 --> 41:19.120
As long as I don't look at him,

41:20.080 --> 41:22.840
he won't notice me.

41:27.400 --> 41:29.240
- Dr. Fang.
- It's delicious.

41:29.960 --> 41:32.240
I'm eating.

41:33.080 --> 41:33.960
I'm just eating.

42:00.200 --> 42:03.000
Why did the power go out suddenly?

42:05.480 --> 42:06.520
I'll go check what's happening.

42:15.000 --> 42:15.840
No power here either.

42:16.440 --> 42:18.240
The door lock is electronic.
We can't get out.

42:18.320 --> 42:19.400
Can you contact the property management?

42:20.480 --> 42:21.840
I rarely do that.

42:21.920 --> 42:23.000
Let me check.

42:26.840 --> 42:29.200
You two… You're good at hiding this, huh?

42:29.920 --> 42:32.080
This time, I'll expose you both.

42:33.040 --> 42:34.000
ANGRY SISTER

42:34.080 --> 42:34.960
PROPERTY MANAGEMENT

42:35.040 --> 42:35.960
Got it.

42:36.040 --> 42:36.880
CALL

42:38.840 --> 42:39.720
Hello?

42:39.800 --> 42:41.480
The power is out in the lab.

42:42.120 --> 42:45.320
There's an electrical fault
for an unknown reason.

42:45.400 --> 42:47.120
The power staff is coming to fix it.

42:47.200 --> 42:49.600
Please stay in a safe place
and wait for a while.

42:50.200 --> 42:51.640
OK, thank you.

42:52.240 --> 42:53.800
Looks like we'll have to wait.

42:54.800 --> 42:56.720
Don't worry. The power will be back soon.

43:01.080 --> 43:02.720
I'm not worried.

43:02.800 --> 43:04.920
The computer can't start without power.

43:05.000 --> 43:06.320
So, no matter what you ask,

43:06.400 --> 43:08.400
I can always say there's no data,

43:08.480 --> 43:10.080
and I can't explain it now.

43:12.320 --> 43:13.600
It's so dark.

43:13.680 --> 43:15.840
I don't even know what I'm eating.

43:28.440 --> 43:29.800
Our phones are out of power.

43:29.880 --> 43:31.680
We'll both be unreachable soon.

43:34.640 --> 43:35.600
Wait a moment.

43:46.080 --> 43:48.160
A lot of dead batteries
still have some power.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.400
You're amazing.

43:58.280 --> 43:59.480
I didn't expect you to be so humorous.

43:59.560 --> 44:02.200
No. I really think you're amazing.

44:03.040 --> 44:05.560
Dr. Fang. You must be better

44:05.640 --> 44:07.480
at such a simple physics experiment
than I am.

44:11.080 --> 44:12.560
Yes, yes.

44:13.560 --> 44:14.920
I'm Dr. Fang.

44:22.320 --> 44:23.920
Dr. Tang, please.

44:24.000 --> 44:25.560
Dr. Fang, please.

44:30.240 --> 44:31.200
Let's eat.

44:36.120 --> 44:37.240
This beef tendon is really good.

44:38.600 --> 44:40.000
I like this dish from their place too.

44:40.720 --> 44:41.800
Try some of this.

45:26.040 --> 45:26.880
Do you like it?

45:27.760 --> 45:29.000
Yes.

45:29.080 --> 45:30.320
Would you like more?

45:30.400 --> 45:31.480
Yes.

45:37.440 --> 45:38.400
Come in, come in.

45:38.480 --> 45:40.000
You two, I knew
you had something going on.

45:40.080 --> 45:41.560
I'll definitely ruin you both.
